WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:18,700
Accompanying actress, you are having a hard time across the card

2
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,700
Oh my god, Yoyo is so coaxable, right?

4
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:24,700
Come and learn about it

5
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,700
There are two types of children, one is here to collect debts

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:27,700
A repaying little angel like Youyou

7
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,700
Neither of them cherishes it

8
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,760
They will regret it in the future

9
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:39,170
Next is the last gift

10
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:41,650
Didn't you see me coaxing Jiaojiao again?

11
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:42,650
My granddaughter is crying like this

12
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:44,650
You don’t feel sorry for me, I feel sorry for you

13
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:47,840
666 No eyesight anymore

14
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:50,220
Then don't blame me for not being able to save you.

15
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,720
Anyway, Mang River has become Ming River.

16
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,720
Isn’t the last gift given by Youyou?

17
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:06,320
It doesn’t matter when you dismantle it.

18
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:10,240
What, how could this happen?

19
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:15,380
Don't panic. I'll think of a solution here.

20
00:01:15,380 --> 00:01:17,820
What's wrong

21
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:24,480
The Su family is in urgent need of a large number of hundred-year-old human beings.

22
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:29,070
It must be used for money

23
00:01:29,070 --> 00:01:31,140
Su Qian wants to use that child

24
00:01:31,140 --> 00:01:32,140
A hundred years of life

25
00:01:32,140 --> 00:01:35,140
It's not hard to find if you give me a little more time.

26
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:37,230
Just need it urgently

27
00:01:37,230 --> 00:01:38,650
Even if it’s to stay with the family

28
00:01:38,650 --> 00:01:40,650
It won't be easy to find for a while

29
00:01:40,650 --> 00:01:43,650
Our family doesn’t have one that’s that old for the time being.

30
00:01:43,650 --> 00:01:45,650
You call and ask other old friends

31
00:01:45,650 --> 00:01:49,380
The Su family has already asked around.

32
00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:51,380
Everything that can be borrowed has been borrowed

33
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:57,480
Let's think of a solution quickly

34
00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:07,540
Okay, okay, grandpa, that’s fine
